TUR-D0008
defeffect: the trailing ^capability is deprecated; write ^capability before the name: (defeffect ^capability Disk ...)
defeffect: the trailing ^extends Disk is deprecated; write ^extends Disk before the name: (defeffect ^extends Disk Write ...)
defn: #[no-unwind] is deprecated; write ^no-unwind
defn: (export-as "attrs_second") is deprecated; write ^export-as "attrs_second"
